<!--- Start of Project Highlights --->
<section class="desarea">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row justify-content-center text-center">
      <div class="col-lg-12">
        <div class="h2">Birla Estates Sec 71 Gurgaon Project Highlights</div>
          <p class="text-lg-center"><p>Birla Estates, the real estate arm of the prestigious Aditya Birla Group, is all set to launch its latest luxury residential project, Birla Estates Sector 71 Gurgaon. Spread across 5 acres of prime land right on Southern Peripheral Road (SPR), this pre-launch development is poised to redefine modern living in Gurugram. With thoughtfully designed 2, 3 and 4 BHK luxury apartments, the project blends comfort, style, and functionality, catering to families, professionals, NRIs, and investors seeking premium residences in one of NCR’s fastest-growing corridors.</p>

<p>The project carries a development potential of over 1 million sq. ft., with an estimated revenue potential of ₹1,400 crore, a strong indicator of its scale and significance. Backed by Birla Estates’ legacy of excellence, residents here can expect top-notch design, high construction quality, and a lifestyle that embodies luxury at every step.</p>

<p>Birla Sector 71 Gurgaon offers spacious layouts designed with abundant natural light and ventilation. Early plans suggest configurations such as 3 BHK + 3T homes of 1900 sq. ft. and larger 3 BHK + 3T + SR residences of 2300 sq. ft., ensuring ample living space for modern families. Every home is designed as a “Life Designed Home,” balancing aesthetics with functionality. More details on tower count, possession timelines, and master plans will be released soon, but early buzz confirms that this will be one of Gurugram’s most premium high-rise communities.</p>
<p>Birla Estates Sector 71 Gurgaon is a pre-launch project, with pricing yet to be officially announced. Early indications suggest luxury 2, 3, and 4 BHK homes will be available, with detailed pricing and payment plans to be shared closer to the official launch. Interested buyers can pre-register now to secure priority access, special offers, and early-bird benefits.</p>
          
          
      </div>
	  
