          <p>Residents of Birla Estates Sector 71 Gurgaon will enjoy world-class amenities curated to elevate everyday living. The project is planned with a grand clubhouse, landscaped greens, swimming pools, a fitness center, indoor and outdoor sports arenas, kids’ play areas, and community spaces that promote a balanced lifestyle.</p> 
         <p>Entertainment and wellness come alive with facilities such as a mini-theatre, yoga and meditation zones, and dedicated areas for sports like cricket and badminton. The presence of sustainable features, high-end security, and premium interiors makes this a future-ready development.</p>
		  
          
