          <div class="h4">Sector 71 Gurgaon</div>
          <p>The biggest USP of Birla Estates Sector 71 Gurgaon is its unbeatable location. Situated bang on Southern Peripheral Road, the project enjoys smooth connectivity to NH-48, Sohna Road, Dwarka Expressway, and Golf Course Extension Road.</p> 
          <p>The upcoming infrastructure developments in Gurugram further enhance its connectivity and growth potential. The project is surrounded by top schools, reputed hospitals, retail malls, and thriving corporate hubs, making it an ideal address for families and working professionals alike. Residents will also benefit from proximity to Ambience Mall, IGI Airport, and Gurugram’s upcoming metro and expressway projects, ensuring unmatched lifestyle convenience.</p>
                                
